w many jobs cover your costs"}],"id":"l2-s2","placeholder":true,"title":"Pricing"},{"bronzes":[{"id":"l2-s3-b1","placeholder":false,"tasks":[{"id":"l2-s3-b1-t1","placeholder":false,"screens":[{"answerKey":"funding_start","copy":{"borrow":"Borrow it","context":"You know what it costs to start and what you will charge. Before you buy the gear, decide how you will cover that start-up total, from money you already have or by borrowing and paying it back.","disclaimer":"Real loans usually add interest; we've left that out here to keep it simple.","fixedHelp":"Pick how many weeks or months. We work out each payment.","fixedMode":"Same amount over a set time","fixedShow":"You'll pay about {funding_period_payment} {currency} each {unit} for {funding_repay_count} {unit}.","guidance":"Look at your start-up total. If you already have that amount, you can fund it yourself. If you need to borrow, pick a payback plan you can keep. You can repay a set amount over a number of weeks or months, or pick a weekly amount (for example $5 a week) and see how long it takes to pay back the whole start-up total. These sums do not add interest.","missing":"Finish Know your cost first so we can show your start-up total.","missingAction":"Go to Know your cost","ownCash":"From my own cash or savings","ownCashConfirm":"You'll cover your start-up cost of {startup-total} {currency} from your own cash or savings.","paybackTitle":"How will you pay it back?","prompt":"How will you cover it?","weeklyHelp":"Pick a weekly amount. We work out how long it takes.","weeklyMode":"A set amount each week","weeklyShow":"At {funding_weekly_amount} {currency} a week, it will take about {funding_weeks_to_repay} weeks to pay back {startup_total} {currency}."},"costsFrom":"l2-costs","id":"l2-s3-b1-t1-funding","type":"funding-start"}],"title":"Get the money you need to start"}],"title":"Get the money you need to start"}],"id":"l2-s3","placeholder":false,"title":"Funding"}]},{"floorType":"corridor","gold":{"id":"l3-gol