 day,","whether you'll pick up at the owner's home or meet somewhere,","and where the job will happen."],"id":"when_where","lead":"The practical details:","title":"When and where"},{"bullets":["cash on the day,","a bank transfer,","or an app."],"id":"cost_payment","lead":"What the job costs and how you will be paid:","title":"Cost and payment"},{"bullets":["if the owner is running late,","you cannot make it,","the weather is too bad,","the dog seems unwell,","or you need to cut the walk short."],"id":"plans_change","lead":"What you will do if something comes up:","title":"What happens if plans change"}],"answerKey":"agree_the_job","id":"l3-s1-b2-t1-s1","note":"When a booking comes in, write these on the {strong} template in your workbook.","noteStrong":"Taking a customer order","question":"What will you agree with the owner before each job?","readLabel":"I've read this","step":"agree","title":"Agree the job","type":"getting-ready"}],"title":"Agree the job"}],"title":"Agree the job"},{"id":"l3-s1-b3","placeholder":false,"tasks":[{"id":"l3-s1-b3-t1","placeholder":false,"screens":[{"afterOptions":[{"id":"photo","label":"A photo","sentence":"a photo"},{"id":"video","label":"A short video","sentence":"a short video"},{"id":"summary","label":"A written summary","sentence":"a written summary"}],"answerKey":"deliver_the_job","beforeOptions":[{"id":"text","label":"Text","sentence":"text"},{"id":"email","label":"Email","sentence":"email"},{"id":"phone","label":"Phone call","sentence":"phone call"},{"id":"in_person","label":"In person","sentence":"in person"}],"deliverBlocks":[{"heading":"One day before the job","lead":"I will contact the owner to confirm the agreed details of the job by {pick}.","slot":"before"},{"heading":"Straight after I've delivered the service","lead":"I will show proof by sending {pick}.","slot":"after"}],"hint":"For each statement, pick the option that fits how you will do it. The what and when stay the same. Your two choices become your plan.","id":"l