ation (placeholder)"},{"kind":"interactive","label":"Interactive element (placeholder)"}],"id":"l5-s3-b2-t1-s1","type":"placeholder"}],"title":"Task 1"},{"id":"l5-s3-b2-t2","placeholder":true,"screens":[{"blocks":[{"kind":"text","label":"Text block (placeholder)"},{"kind":"illustration","label":"Illustration (placeholder)"},{"kind":"interactive","label":"Interactive element (placeholder)"}],"id":"l5-s3-b2-t2-s1","type":"placeholder"}],"title":"Task 2"},{"id":"l5-s3-b2-t3","placeholder":true,"screens":[{"blocks":[{"kind":"text","label":"Text block (placeholder)"},{"kind":"illustration","label":"Illustration (placeholder)"},{"kind":"interactive","label":"Interactive element (placeholder)"}],"id":"l5-s3-b2-t3-s1","type":"placeholder"}],"title":"Task 3"}],"title":"Calculate what's left"}],"id":"l5-s3","placeholder":true,"title":"Know your profit"}]},{"floorType":"corridor","gold":{"id":"l6-gold","title":"Know what you owe, what you keep, and where every dollar goes."},"level":6,"name":"Budgeting","silvers":[{"bronzes":[{"id":"l6-s1-b1","placeholder":false,"tasks":[{"id":"l6-s1-b1-t1","placeholder":false,"screens":[{"id":"l6-s1-b1-t1-s1","pages":[{"alt":"Lars dropping a coin into a cash box","audio":{"durationMs":15073,"src":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s1-vo.mp3"},"body":"Your business is starting to make money. Now it's time to decide what that money does. Without a plan, it's easy to spend it all and wonder where it went. A budget is that plan. It makes sure your costs are covered, your business keeps going, and you still get to enjoy what you earned.","credit":"Voice created with Grok","id":"s1","image":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s1-lars-cashbox.webp"},{"alt":"Lars beside a tower of bricks, with a house, a car and a rocket","audio":{"durationMs":20820,"src":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s2-vo.mp3"},"body":"Imagine all the money you've made is a pile of 100 build bricks. You could use every piece on one big tower. Then the tower is the only thing you get. Or you could plan a few smaller builds, like a house, a car and a rocket. Before you start, you check how many pieces each one needs. That way you know if you have enough, or if you need to collect more pieces first.","id":"s2","image":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s2-lars-tower.webp"},{"alt":"A half-built house, car and rocket with loose bricks","audio":{"durationMs":24346,"src":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s3-vo.mp3"},"body":"That's what a budget does with your money. The house, the car and the rocket are like budget items. Each budget item is a small goal your money works toward, like covering costs, saving for emergencies, paying yourself and giving. Every time you earn money, you add a few pieces to each budget item. You might not have all the pieces at the start. But you can watch each build come together piece by piece, and you always know how many more pieces it needs.","id":"s3","image":"/launchpad/budgeting/l6-s3-half-built.webp"},{"id":"s4","split":true}],"title":"Budgeting","type":"picture","voice":true}],"title":"Budgeting"}],"title":"Budgeting"}],"id":"l6-s1","placeholder":false,"title":"Budgeting"}]},{"floorType":"corridor","gold":{"id":"l7-gold","title":"Know what to improve, how to keep customers coming back, where to grow, and how to fund it."},"level":7,"name":"Growing","silvers":[{"bronzes":[{"id":"l7-s1-b1","placeholder":false,"tasks":[{"id":"l7-s1-b1-t1","placeholder":false,"screens":[{"answerKey":"l7-reflect","content":{"grow":{"calendarNote":"NextGenAchiever$ check-in: review what worked, what to fix, and where to grow.","checkIn":"Your next check-in: {date}","checkInLabel":"Check-in","checkInOptions":[{"id":"one-month","label":"one month","months":1,"period":"one month"},{"id":"two-months","label":"two months","months":2,"period":"two months"},{"id":"three-months","label":"three months","months":3,"period":"three months"}],"closerContext":"Checking in every three months shows you how your business is going. Set a reminder so you don't forget.","closerHeadline":"See you in 